    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "59cf2bd4_92ec4737",
        "filename": "common/vboot_hash.c",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 388,
      "author": {
        "id": 1001696
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-08-21T23:51:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As you noted in your commit message, we\u0027re now hashing the entire region rather than just the image portion. Can you double check there are no boards that write misc. non-image data to the RW region during runtime? Eg. usb_pd_policy.c can write an RSA sig at runtime (see FW_RW_END). I guess this particular case is fine since we won\u0027t do both RSA verification and EFS on a board, but I wonder if there are other cases.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 388,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 388,
        "endChar": 41
      },
      "revId": "d11a5a67ee8d8a8b62692ee2970241bb4267a86a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2ad7103a_1d45e8d7",
        "filename": "common/vboot_hash.c",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 388,
      "author": {
        "id": 1106949
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-08-22T02:16:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are lots of code using RW region for various purposes:\n\nmany calls to flash_write and flash_physical_write for cr50/cr51/cr52\nrollback.c for hammer and staff\nupdate_fw.c for hammer, polyberry, servo_micro, servo_v4, staff, sweetberry, tigertail\nnvmem.c for cr50, mn50\nEC_CMD_FLASH_WRITE for Depthcharge (soft sync)\n\nNone of these are conflicting with EFS currently.\n\nI didn\u0027t go into details about what exactly these boards are writing. If they ever need to use EFS, they need to define a separate RW region. Similarly, if EFS boards ever need to store some runtime data in flash, we need to define a separate RW region. I think it\u0027s a sensible design. We separate data which require verification and other data which can change dynamically.",
      "parentUuid": "59cf2bd4_92ec4737",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 388,
        "startChar": 23,
        "endLine": 388,
        "endChar": 41
      },
      "revId": "d11a5a67ee8d8a8b62692ee2970241bb4267a86a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": false
    },
